    {
      "id": "operator-networking-ii-interfaces-lesson",
      "slug": "interfaces",
      "title": "Interfaces и addresses",
      "type": "theory",
      "order": 1,
      "category": "networking",
      "concept": "network_interfaces",
      "version": 1,
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "heading",
          "text": "Interfaces и addresses"
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "`ip -brief addr` показывает interfaces и addresses компактно. Prefix длина описывает network boundary, но не гарантирует route или listener."
        },
        {
          "type": "code",
          "language": "bash",
          "code": "ip -brief -4 addr"
        },
        {
          "type": "bullets",
          "items": [
            "Цель: Покажите interfaces и IPv4 addresses.",
            "Проверка: Address и prefix описывают local configuration, не внешний reachability."
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "note",
          "tone": "note",
          "text": "Address и prefix описывают local configuration, не внешний reachability."
        }
      ],
      "completion": {
        "explicitContinue": true
      }
    },
